              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BARTNSIS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We’ve been making this for decades and everyone loves it….except we use a teaspoon of Tang Drink Mix ( or more to taste preference) instead of the orange liqueur and orange zest. So good, especially with strawberries and bananas!",
