              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LWORTH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I served this at a baby shower with fruit kabobs along with chocolate dip. Hardly anyone touched the chocolate...this recipe was all gone and I even made a double batch. \r\nI did use OJ instead of liqueor and it tasted wonderful",
            "datePublished": "2003-03-16T13:56:59.263Z"
